Z||000006||Adrift||12-18-2001||02:07 AM||||Triad, your in the wrong market - in Europe the change over to the Euro has caused a huge increase in exotic car sales (people want to hold goods rather then currency, and exotic cars are probably the easiest way to get rid of large amounts of currency!). You should get some cars into France and sell them there, you could make quite a bundle.||||reg||1
